OL,3,AMet Police 'triaging' calls about
OL,4,ARussell Brand following conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe officer who led the investigation
OL,7,Finto Russell Brand has said the
OL,8,FMetropolitan Police is "triaging" calls
OL,9,Ffrom people following his conviction
OL,10,Fand sentence.
OL,12,FSpeaking to BBC Breakfast on Tuesday,
OL,13,FDet Supt Andy Furphy said the force had
OL,14,F"several reports in during the trial
OL,15,Fand since the trial".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
