OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMet Police 'triaging' calls about
OL,4,ARussell Brand following conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said that officers were in the
OL,7,F"process of triaging" them and were
OL,8,F"looking at exactly what we've got,
OL,9,Fwhether they're information that points
OL,10,Fto behaviour or whether they could
OL,11,Fconstitute a criminal offence, so our
OL,12,Fwork isn't done."
OL,14,FBrand is already being investigated
OL,15,Fover rape allegations from two more
OL,16,Fwomen. He has been interviewed under
OL,17,Fcaution in connection to those
OL,18,Fallegations.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
